  "body": "You guys need to figure out a way to prevent old rooms that have been upgraded from appearing in the room directory. For example the old `#synapse:matrix.org` room still appears and ranks higher than the current one in the matrix.org room directory. I am searching the room directory from a brand new server (just setup 15 minutes ago) so it is definitely not a caching issue on my end.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"744\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5855073/119729087-dae84300-be39-11eb-8fc1-2b4257272fe5.png\">\r\n",
